This appeal under Section 173(1) of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 (hereinafter referred to as 'the Act',
for short) has been filed by the claimants being aggrieved by the judgment and award dated 19.02.2020 passed by the IX Addl. Small Causes & C/c XXII ASCJ and MACT, Bangalore (SCCH-24)
